  "description": "In a Tokyo where gravity has broken, a boy and a girl are drawn to each other...<br>\n<br>\nThe story is set in Tokyo, after bubbles that broke the laws of gravity rained down upon the world. Cut off from the outside world, Tokyo has become a playground for a group of young people who have lost their families, acting as a battlefield for parkour team battles as they leap from building to building. Hibiki, a young ace known for his dangerous play style, makes a reckless move one day and plummets into the gravity-bending sea. His life is saved by Uta, a girl with mysterious powers. The pair then hear a unique sound audible only to them. Why did Uta appear before Hibiki? Their encounter leads to a revelation that will change the world.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Netflix)<br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: The anime released on Netflix on April 28, 2022. It screened in theaters on May 13, 2022.</i>",
